  "description": "Ha-Na (Hae Na) has made every effort to avoid an inevitable family curse... of turning into a dog after her first kiss. Worst of all, the only way for her to break the curse is to get a second kiss. How will that work when Ha-Na’s first kiss is with a guy who is deathly afraid of dogs?! \n\n(Source: WEBTOON) \n\n*Note: Includes four extra chapters.*",
